config WIFI_PPT_TASKSTACK_SIZE
    int "ppT task stack size" if !ESP8266_OSS_PHY_ONLY
    range 2048 8192
    default 2048 if !ESP8266_WIFI_ENABLE_WPA3_SAE
    default 5120 if ESP8266_WIFI_ENABLE_WPA3_SAE
    help
        Configure the Wi-Fi worker task stack size (bytes).

        - Open-source Wi-Fi: sets the n8_worker_task stack size, silently
          floored at 3072 bytes at runtime (even if configured lower).
        - Vendor Wi-Fi: sets the ppT task stack size (2048..8192).

        This task also invokes the promiscuous RX callback; increase the
        stack size if user callbacks are complex.

